+# Instruction checklist
+
+| Requirement | Result | Limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Preserve the full five-track goal | All eighteen dependencies/owner assignments retained; current named source-status files checked | No criterion closed or scope exception inferred |
+| FAA first, then available operational work | Two distinct prior-query-checked federal oversight searches; no case counterpart located; then genuinely unseen telephone mirror regions inspected | No failed search treated as proof of absence or native acquisition |
+| Obtain underlying records rather than more summaries | Newly inspected source-page footers supply exact counterpart retrieval keys | Still a public mirror; native records and required empirical tests remain missing |
+| Preserve original wording/conflicts | Earlier unobserved/null state, rows, clock uncertainty, conditional retrieval and source qualifications preserved | New observations are additive, not causal reconciliation or a preferred account |
+| Reading/provenance fidelity | Four pages partially viewed through eight screenshot calls, including overlap/repeat; only one code-free local footer capture saved | No full-page/full-log or nativePDF hash claim |
+| Coordinate without duplicating technical/audit work | Existing current recorder/materials report/receipt and audit chat state read; no message/restart or technical work performed there | Active chat status is not a verified live original-record job or acceptance |
+| Keep missing inputs as TODOs | Existing telephone/source IDs and ALL18 remain open/partial | No recording delivery, historical clocks, custody or source-native joins proved |
+| Revision accountability | Exact Git text-addition diff; prior report/scope/TODO bytes unchanged | Diff is research text, not original log-version diff; source image review separate |
+| Safe AveLyra publication | Only original notes, locators, TODOs, checklist, provenance and reference checks; raw capture/contact/code/private-case data excluded | Commit/push/account/remote file verification performed separately after frozen review; no main merge or private push |
+
+No outreach, fees, mailbox access, new request/filing, deletion, history rewrite, source repair or access-gate bypass. New source locators change the next retrieval action, not the historical evidentiary conclusion or substantive completion state.
